        "suggested": {
            "title": "Stop Using AI for Captions — Build Content Machines Instead",
            "description": "Most people use AI to write a caption or make a funny image, and then wonder why their social media isn't growing. The real unlock is building content machines: systems where one input produces a finished, high-quality post with captions, animations, VFX and overlays already done. A content machine isn't just a faster workflow — it's an entire team doing the job for you.",
