    "transcript": {
        "duration": 42,
        "text": "do? Well, this is where AI comes in. I don't mean AI as going to GPT and getting some tests for a post or even generate a funny image. That helps, but that's not really using AI. That's not what you need to do in order to grow your social media. You need what I call content machines. You need a machine that you give it an input and it generates a fully fledged, really high quality post. It can be a video where it generates the captions, the animations and VFX, overlays on your image. It can be Instagram posts, but the key is to get as little work as possible, but still get the highest possible quality of posts. So content machines are not just faster systems. Content machines are full teams that will do the job.",
